9s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Far behind him there was a fierce fight for second position between du Pouget, Fourny, Dreyfus, \"Sabipa\" and Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":12,"text":"However on the 12th lap Etancelin had to retire from the race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":15,"text":"Lehoux improves further, with laps of 3m57s and 3m55s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"Lehoux did 18 laps, half the race, in 1h13m23s (118.6 km/h).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"Fourny is second, 1m14s behind; du Pouget third, 1m27s back.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":21,"text":"Du Pouget takes over second place.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":25,"text":"Fourny retakes second place from du Pouget.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"Young drivers Fourny and du Pouget, who until now only had had local successes, were the surprise of the race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":28,"text":"Dreyfus has plug trouble and drops back.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux leads by over two minutes; du Pouget is 18 seconds behind Fourny and closing.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":31,"text":"With the car back in working order Dreyfus made the 31th lap in a record time 3m52s (125.1 km/h).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":31,"text":"Du Pouget cuts the gap to Fourny to 11 seconds.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":32,"text":"The gap is down to 5 seconds.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":33,"text":"Fourny answers; the gap is 4 seconds.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":36,"text":"Lehoux wins, flat out on the last lap in 3m50.6s; Fourny second by 2 seconds from du Pouget, 2 1/2 minutes behind Lehoux.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":36,"text":"Du Pouget was third overall, \"Sabipa\" fourth and Dreyfus fifth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":36,"text":"Auber beats Gaupillat in the 1500cc class.","q":false,"c":6}]}